WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.530
Three neighbours.

2
00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:05.670
One terrible run of luck,
hitting all of them at once.

3
00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:07.000
A job lost.

4
00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:08.850
A relationship over.

5
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.000
A move to somewhere new.

6
00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:14.200
Weeks later, two of them
are getting on with life.

7
00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:17.750
The third has a grey cloud
that just won't lift.

8
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:20.280
Same events, different outcome.

9
00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:24.990
So why do the same hard times trigger
depression in only some people?

10
00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:28.580
In this mission, you'll look
for causes inside the body.

11
00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:32.500
That's nature: inherited,
biological influences.

12
00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:36.200
And you'll weigh that against
nurture: stressful life events,

13
00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:39.770
like losing a job, that
make depression more likely.

14
00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:44.140
Your mission: explain why one person's
hard times turn into depression,

15
00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:45.640
while another's don't.
